{"id": "EUVD-2026-103459", "enisaUuid": "bbad379c-5331-33ce-a358-263e1e09fb1e", "description": "OpenTelemetry opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http 1.5.0 before 1.45.0 contains an improper certificate validation vulnerability that disables TLS verification when OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_CERTIFICATE variables are empty strings. Man-in-the-middle attackers can impersonate the collector to read or alter exported traces, metrics, and logs, including authentication headers from OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T11:38:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T15:59:16", "baseScore": 8.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python/commit/89cc68b9ea7e15969b4f042d63397bdc74a3d60e", "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python/releases/tag/v1.45.0", "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python/blob/v1.44.0/exporter/opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http/src/opentelemetry/exporter/otlp/proto/http/trace_exporter/__init__.py#L93-L96", "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python/blob/v1.44.0/exporter/opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http/src/opentelemetry/exporter/otlp/proto/http/trace_exporter/__init__.py#L170-L185", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/opentelemetry-opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http-1.5.0-before-1.45.0-improper-certificate-validation"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112006", "GHSA-6469-8p9h-mmvm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3c94ca90-3edc-362f-835d-92a2dfba9025", "product": {"name": "opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http", "vendor": {"name": "OpenTelemetry"}}, "product_version": "1.5.0 <1.45.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b7be4278-7c03-364c-b38e-5dbf2c6d28b8", "vendor": {"name": "OpenTelemetry"}}], "isExploited": false}